ther your home needs major repairs, has foundation issues, outdated interiors, or is move-in ready - we'll make you a fair cash offer. You don't need to fix anything or even clean. We buy as-is."}]]}],["$","$L9","2",{"value":"item-2","data-testid":"faq-item-2","children":[["$","$La",null,{"className":"text-left text-base font-semibold hover:text-primary","data-testid":"faq-trigger-2","children":"How do I get a cash offer for my Boise home?"}],["$","$Lb",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","data-testid":"faq-content-2","children":"Getting your cash offer is simple! Fill out our online form or call (208) 405-CASH. Tell us about your property and situation. We'll research comparable sales and present you with a fair, no-obligation cash offer within 24 hours - often the same day."}]]}],["$","$L9","3",{"value":"item-3","data-testid":"faq-item-3","children":[["$","$La",null,{"className":"text-left text-base font-semibold hover:text-primary","data-testid":"faq-trigger-3","children":"What areas do you serve in the Treasure Valley?"}],["$","$Lb",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","data-testid":"faq-content-3","children":"We buy houses throughout the entire Treasure Valley including Boise, Boise, Meridian, Eagle, Kuna, Star, and Middleton. As local Idaho cash home buyers, we're committed to serving all these communities with fast, fair offers and flexible closing timelines."}]]}],["$","$L9","4",{"value":"item-4","data-testid":"faq-item-4","children":[["$","$La",null,{"className":"text-left text-base font-semibold hover:text-primary","data-testid":"faq-trigger-4","children":"Why choose Home Buyer Boise over listing with a realtor?"}],["$","$Lb",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","data-testid":"faq-content-4","children":"When you need to sell fast in Boise, cash buyers offer major advantages: no realtor commissions (save 5-6%), no repairs or cleaning needed, no showings or open houses, close in days not months, and we pay all closing costs. You receive your offer amount minus nothing - what we offer is what you get at closing."}]]}],["$","$L9","5",{"value":"item-5","data-testid":"faq-item-5","children":[["$","$La",null,{"className":"text-left text-base font-semibold hover:text-primary","data-testid":"faq-trigger-5","children":"Are there any fees when selling to Home Buyer Boise?"}],["$","$Lb",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","data-testid":"faq-content-5","children":"Absolutely zero fees! Unlike traditional sales where you pay 5-6% realtor commissions plus 2-3% closing costs, we cover everything. No commissions, no closing costs, no inspection fees, no appraisal fees. The cash offer we present is exactly what you'll receive at closing - 100% of it."}]]}]]}]}]]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"py-16 md:py-24 bg-muted/30","data-testid":"credentials-section","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container px-4","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-center mb-12","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold mb-3","children":["Why Trust ","Home Buyer Boise","?"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto","children":"We're not just another \"we buy houses\" company. We're a legitimate, established business with credentials to back up our promises."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 rounded-lg bg-card border hover-elevate transition-all duration-200","data-testid":"credential-0","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-shield h-6 w-6 text-primary","